{
  "Displays events in chronological order. In the vertical layout, each event is a card next to a line with a marker. In the horizontal layout, events appear along a line of dates, and selecting a date shows that event's card below the line. Dates are formatted in the kit language. For scheduling by the hour, see [Scheduler](/scheduler).": "",
  "Vertical layout": "",
  "`items` defines the events, each with a `date`, a `title`, a `description`, a `tone` for the marker and a `glyph` inside it. `alternate` places the cards on alternating sides of the line, and `collapsible` hides descriptions until a card is clicked. `onItemClick` reports the click.": "",
  "Horizontal layout": "",
  "`orientation='horizontal'` places the dates on a scrollable line with buttons at each end. The selected event (`value`, `x-model`) shows its card below the line. The arrow keys move between dates, and `dateFormat` accepts `Intl.DateTimeFormat` options.": "",
  "An item's `content` adds custom content to its card, in addition to the text. `icon` places a custom icon in the marker. A date includes the time when `dateFormat` specifies it.": "",
  "In the vertical layout, each collapsible card is a Tab stop. In the horizontal layout, the selected date is one Tab stop, and the track buttons are also Tab stops.": "",
  "In the horizontal layout, Left and Right show the previous or next event (reversed on right-to-left pages), and Home and End show the first and last.": "",
  "On a collapsible card, expands or collapses it. On a date, shows it.": "",
  "A `list` named by `label`, with one item per event. A date is a `time` element with its ISO value, and a collapsible card is a button with `aria-expanded` that controls its description.": "",
  "The dates are tabs (`tablist`, `tab`, `aria-selected`), and the card below them is the `tabpanel` they control. The buttons at the ends are named “Earlier” and “Later”.": "",
  "Decorative. The tone is conveyed only by color, so put important information in the title.": "",
  "The timeline. `data-orientation`, `data-alternate`.": "Timeline. `data-orientation`, `data-alternate`.",
  "The list (the line is its `::before`) and an event (`data-tone`, `data-side`, `data-expanded`, `data-selected`).": "Liste (çizgi onun `::before` öğesidir) ve bir event (`data-tone`, `data-side`, `data-expanded`, `data-selected`).",
  "The marker and its content.": "",
  "A card in the vertical layout, a date in the horizontal layout, and the card below the line.": "",
  "The text and custom content.": "",
  "The scrolling track, its buttons and their arrows.": "",
  "Units: the line, a marker and its glyph (by tone), a card (`pressable`, `hover`, `pressed`, `focus`, `expanded`), a date item (`hover`, `pressed`, `focus`, `selected`), the text, the detail card and the track buttons.": "",
  "The gap between events, between a marker and its card, between dates, and between the track and the detail card, plus the marker size and line thickness.": "",
  "The events in order: `date` (a `Date`, an ISO string or milliseconds), `title`, `description`, `glyph` or `icon`, `tone`, `content`, `key` and `data`.": "",
  "`vertical` shows a card per event down the page. `horizontal` shows a line of dates with the selected event's card below it.": "",
  "In the vertical layout, places cards on alternating sides of the line.": "",
  "In the vertical layout, shows a card's description only when clicked.": "",
  "`short`, `medium`, `long` or `Intl.DateTimeFormat` options. Dates use the kit language.": "",
  "In the horizontal layout, the event whose card is shown, identified by its `key` or index. `x-model` provides two-way binding.": "",
  "The kit string “Timeline”": "",
  "Occurs when an event's card or date is clicked (`index`, `item`).": "",
  "In the horizontal layout, occurs when the selected event changes (`index`, `item`, `previous`, `byUser`).": "",
  "In the horizontal layout, the index of the selected event, or -1 if there is none.": "",
  "The number of events.": "",
  "In the horizontal layout, shows an event by index or key. In the vertical layout, expands its card.": "",
  "In the vertical layout with `collapsible`, expands or collapses a card, or reports whether it is expanded.": "",
  "Formats a date the same way the timeline does.": ""
}
